# `build.shared_library` has no compile mode yet. It used to be compiled as an
# EXECUTABLE into lib/ and fail on the missing `main` with a linker dump
# (issues/shared-library-artifact-is-compiled-as-an-executable.md); until the
# shared-library mode lands (plans/BUILD_AND_DEPENDENCY_SYSTEM_REDESIGN.md
# §4.5.4) the build must fail with a message that names the artifact and the
# alternative. Only that message and the rc are pinned.
stdout_keep_match=shared_library "addshared" is not supported yet.*Use static_library\.
